{
  "name": "@swao/module-health-check",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "SWAO health-check module: the health-check / health-check-pii / health-check-tags commands and the diagnostic probe registry (ProbeContribution[]). Host-coupled probes (Playwright, compliance catalogues, VCS auth, import templates, audit ingestion) are injected by the host; health-check-only probes live here.",
